      "content": "I will admit that I had never heard of the Jacobian Conjecture until yesterday, but I am also surprised anyone thought it was true. Local invertibility of a Jacobian doesn't imply invertibility for differentiable functions. Why should it for polynomials?\n\nMath is too weird.",
